{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2021-09-28 08:00:00', 'title': 'AGILENT ANNOUNCES THOUGHT LEADER AWARD TO BERNHARD LENDL AT THE TU WIEN (VIENNA)', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES INC. (NYSE: A) TODAY ANNOUNCED PROFESSOR BERNHARD LENDL HAS BEEN SELECTED TO RECEIVE A PRESTIGIOUS AGILENT THOUGHT LEADER AWARD. HIGHLY RENOWNED IN THE FIELD OF VIBRATIONAL SPECTROSCOPY, DR. LENDL IS A PROFESSOR AT THE TU WIEN (VIENNA) AND HEAD OF THE WORKING GROUP ON PROCESS ANALYSIS & VIBRATIONAL SPECTROSCOPY AT THE INSTITUTION. PROFESSOR LENDL'S WORK FOCUSES ON ADAPTING POWERFUL SPECTROSCOPIC TECHNIQUES AND UNIQUE COMBINATIONS OF"}